<title>USA: National Health, Pfizer sign deal.</title>
<headline>National Health, Pfizer sign deal.</headline>
<dateline>PHOENIX 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Health Enhancement Systems Inc on Wednesday said it has signed a three-year pact with Pfizer Inc unit Pfizer Health Solutions under which the two will develop and distribute medical products.</p>
<p>In a statement, National Health said it could receive up to $3.75 million from Pfizer if it reaches certain contract milestones during the three year term.</p>
</text>
